 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "No motif on the Prophet ﷺ (119) or on Hell (119). The gloss on 120 notes that the address concerns the whole ummah (Al-Muyassar). STAGING v4: 118: the ignorant demand a sign (speak, point); the signs made clear for the people of certainty = light on the believers. 119: the Prophet is never shown: glad tidings on the believers, warning on the stubborn; Hell is not pictured. 120: the People of the Book call to their religion; the believers (the address includes the whole ummah, Al-Muyassar) refuse their desires; light plate for «هدى الله». 121: those of the People of the Book who recite it as it should be recited read the book (both tafsirs)."
 },
